#X text 2222 20 enomik.recv [port], f 45;
#X text 2222 45 Collects enomik SysEx replies from [sysexin]., f 45;
#X text 2222 90 Left outlet: CMD payload... for every reply (feed enomik.parse)., f 45;
#X text 2222 135 Right outlet: failed_request error_code [context] for error replies., f 45;
#X text 2222 180 Errors are also printed by name., f 45;
#X text 2222 205 Port: only listen to this MIDI in device (default 0 = all)., f 45;
#X text 2222 250 Inlet: raw bytes (floats or lists) instead of [sysexin] \, e.g. for tests., f 45;
